WEBVTT

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:07.610
Morning!

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.190
Oh, morning!

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.030
Long time no see!

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.700
Whoa, you're tanned! Did you go to the beach?

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.320
Yuuko-chan!

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.160
Hm?

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.870
Yuuko-chan, morning!

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.160
Ah, Run, Tooru! Good morning!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.000
Morning.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.630
Well, school's started.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:26.920
That's right.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.170
It's a shame summer vacation's over.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.170
But we had a lot of fun!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.680
I guess so.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.550
Ah. Nagi.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.180
Nagi-chan, good morning!

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.100
Shh!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.100
What are you doing?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.600
You'll be late.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.610
Good morning!

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.520
Uh-oh.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.490
Good morning!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.740
Y-Yes! G-Good morning, Kitou-sensei!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.320
What's the matter?

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.910
It's the long-awaited new semester!

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.160
You ought to have more pep in the morning!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.660
Let's try that once more.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.040
Now!

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.250
Good morning!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.590
G-Good morning!

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.920
Still not enough!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.050
One more try!

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.760
Good morning! Go on.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.390
Good morning!

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.430
<i>I'm sorry, Yuuko!</i>

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.870
First morning of the new semester and you're already too intense.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.210
The students are gonna hate you.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.840
I-It's not like I'm trying to be friends with the students!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.460
Rather, these students need a mentor.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.340
But all things call for moderation, no?

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:26.100
Sometimes you should just leave things alone... right?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.640
Satou. Mornin'.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.390
The way Kamate-chan leaves things alone is sublime.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.150
It lets you relax in tense situations.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.900
Ah, it sends shivers down my spine.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:41.570
Yes... this indifference that seems to deny my very existence...

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:46.580
Don't utter such sickening remarks! It's highly unpleasant.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.000
<i>Kitou, you should just ignore him.</i>

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.460
Kitou-sensei,

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:56.090
that shouting of yours is giving me a headache, so would you stop?

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.710
Well, dear sir, perhaps a return to the nurse's office is in order.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.630
Why don't you head to your classroom?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.430
Your beloved students are there. Run along, now.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.350
What kind of attitude is that?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:10.180
Close enough whatever-they-are's to argue, huh?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.230
Hey, why aren't you two dating already?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.520
Even for a joke, that's not funny.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.520
You're perfectly synchronized, too.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.650
She's way too intense this early in the morning.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.530
Really?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.450
Morning, Run-chan!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.450
Morning! Long time no see!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.410
Morning!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.290
Ooh, you're tanned!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:30.870
Where did you go?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.750
The boys are at it again.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:36.080
Really? How nice!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.090
And there she is. The first-year that loves Run-chan.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.090
Hard at work as soon as the semester starts.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.090
Even though she's tiny.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.640
Tooru?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.810
You're tall!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.820
W-We're sorry.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.040
That was awful of you to leave me behind like that.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.540
Aw, we're sorry, Yuuko.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.080
Honestly, it was terrible-

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:16.540
Huh?

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.380
Why are you holding a chair?

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:20.800
I wonder.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.050
Good morning!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.260
Right, right, that's what I'm talking about!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.230
<i>Toorun and Miporin are chatting!</i>

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.310
Let Yutaka join in, too!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.270
Japan's political and economic situation...

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.900
Easing of regulations should come first, shouldn't it?

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.650
What's wrong? Yutaka?

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:49.030
Japan's political and economic situation... easing of regulations...

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:54.250
It's too complicated. More than Yutaka can handle!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.040
Oh yeah, did you see that drama yesterday?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.840
Yeah, I did. The hot-blooded school-life drama!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.380
The person playing the teacher was really intense.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.430
But that's what I like about it.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.220
Toorun! Miporin!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.010
Good morning!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.520
Cut it out! It's hot, Yutaka!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.270
Heheheh...

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.900
Okay! Return to your seats!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.400
Good morning!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.200
The second semester starts today!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.370
Let's all get energized!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.160
Good morning!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.880
Begin warming up!

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.470
Don't be sloppy or you'll hurt yourself.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:55.140
<i>I just can't get enough of that lax attitude.</i>

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:00.730
Hey, Tooru-san.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.190
What?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.400
Continuing where we left off earlier...

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:05.980
Tooooruuun!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.690
Now it's Yutaka's turn!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.610
S-Stop it...

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:11.490
Now see here...

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:15.740
I missed you so much! Summer vacation was too long!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.660
You met her at the mid-break review, didn't you?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.460
Don't remember that!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.080
Oh, really?

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.380
<i>Hm? Is this...?</i>

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:25.460
Huh?

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.130
Okay! Three minutes is up.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.970
Step away from Tooru-san immediately.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.300
Whaaat? Already?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:35.760
Yutaka!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:36.890
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.270
The Three Minute Rule.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.020
That's the rule for Tooru-san fans!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.440
Um, you said you were a "fan" before, too.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.940
Did I do something special?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.030
Tooru-san, you're good at everything,

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.200
but you're not stuck-up about it.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.870
That's right, that's right!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.700
Plus, you're always so cool and collected.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:00.250
Right?

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.960
Well, I'm sure you hear this all the time...

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.800
Huh? Tooru-san?

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.960
Where's Tooru-san?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.050
What's wrong?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.390
Nothing.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.390
Tooruuun!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.470
Tooru-san! May I have a moment?

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.480
I'd like to ask a favor.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:24.270
Oh. Certainly, Kitou-sensei.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.270
Toorun...

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.650
Sorry for interrupting your conversation.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.780
I'll be borrowing Tooru-san.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.740
I'd like you to go get the assignment notebooks.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:33.780
Understood.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.820
It's not fair.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.200
What is?

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:41.160
Even if she's the teacher, she should follow the Three Minute Rule...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:41.750
Wait!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.500
In that case, I'm counting on you.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:44.960
Got it.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.330
That's far enough!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.250
Three minutes are up!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.090
Any more than that-

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:52.130
See you later, Tooru-san!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.260
Th-Three minute- three...

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:56.760
Here.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.260
Take care of these, please.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.350
Understood.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.220
Oh, I forgot.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.850
Can you take these, too?

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.100
Uh, sure.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.690
And while you're at it, get me a coffee from the vending machine.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:11.360
Wha-?

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:15.650
Kamate-sensei! Don't take advantage of the students, please!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.870
I don't want to hear that from you.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.950
Well, you could buy it instead.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:25.000
Go buy it yourself!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.250
Let's see...

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.550
Ah, excuse me for a second here...

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:40.640
Now I wonder whose notebook this is?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.390
You're fine with black coffee, right?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.520
Thanks a bunch.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.280
Toorun's taking too long. Yutaka is lonely.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.660
She'll be back soon.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:09:59.570
Ah!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:01.160
That's...

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.280
What is it?

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.660
It's the upperclassmen Tooru-san's always with!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.540
You're right!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:11.500
That Fair-Skinned-senpai is pretty cute!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:12.750
Yeah.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.880
Glasses-senpai has a very intellectual air.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:17.930
Oh.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:21.800
The one who looks like a model...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.520
She's Tall-senpai, isn't she?

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:27.810
<i>Where's the fire?</i>

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.810
No. That would be Mop-senpai.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:32.940
I see!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:37.860
What's up? Caught a cold?

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.070
I know a way to get rid of it!

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.660
I think you're supposed to hit her hard in the middle of her back.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:45.410
What?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.910
That's for hiccups.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.370
You've got it wrong.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:48.830
Huh?

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:50.710
Who's that?!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.710
You're supposed to hit the solar plexus.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.670
Tooru!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.550
Sheesh, don't scare us!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.380
It's Tooru-san!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.050
Wonder what they're talking about?

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:02.550
Oh!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.850
They're such good friends.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.310
They sure are.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.140
Wha-

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.020
We'll help!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.270
Thank you.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:14.860
Hup.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.190
I'll take these.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.950
You don't have to take them all.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.030
You carried them by yourself all the way here.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.950
This way we're splitting the work evenly.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.540
<i>She's totally embarrassed.</i>

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.420
How heartwarming.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.170
Yeah.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:37.670
Huh?

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.470
Senpai's started chatting with a boy.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.380
Huh?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.640
Toorun's disappeared.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.970
Oh, she's back!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.020
With a bat. Is she going to play baseball?

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.020
Whoa!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.690
Safe and sound.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:06.990
I'm leaving now!

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.130
Good morning!

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:24.800
G-Good morning, Kitou-sensei!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.850
She caught me again...

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.720
Guess today's not your day.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.480
Tell me about it.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.150
Oh, speaking of which, Tooru hasn't come by today, has she?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.940
Cleaning duty again?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.070
No, we're in the middle of a fight.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.450
What? For real?

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.530
Wha- Are you okay?

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.580
Yeah, it happens once in a while.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.910
The two of them, in a fight! What do we do, Nagi?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.870
This is no time for you to be getting upset!

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.210
Calm down!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.540
But I mean-

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.880
I mean, a fight- I can't believe it!

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.800
I told you, calm down!

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.010
A-At any rate, let's ask why.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:08.970
Right.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.180
So? Why are you fighting?

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.020
Well, you see...

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.950
It's gotten late.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.320
I'll walk you home.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:27.660
I'll be fine.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.410
But I heard there are perverts roaming the streets lately.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:36.330
Then you'd be the one in danger on your way home alone from my place.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:36.830
I said I'm fine.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.130
You'd be in danger!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.420
I'm the one who's safe!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.710
What reason do you have for that?

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.550
What about you? What if something happens?

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.510
We're in the same neighborhood! It's fine!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.260
Well, the same goes for me!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.180
Well, the same goes for <i>me!</i>

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.430
It's more the same for me!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.230
... and we ended up arguing over it.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.190
So what did you end up doing?

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.650
She slept over at my house.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.740
While you were still fighting?!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:06.570
Yeah.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.330
Can you even call that fighting?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.050
<i>I can't believe Run and Tooru are fighting.</i>

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.010
<i>I'll bet Tooru's feeling depressed.</i>

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.150
<i>Tooru!</i>

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.700
Run-chan, you jerk.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.330
<i>Wow. Drowning her sorrows in juice.</i>

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.540
<i>It's hard to butt in with this atmosphere.</i>

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.710
<i>Don't tell me she noticed me!</i>

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.010
<i>Bulls-eye each time!</i>

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.470
Then I'll bring it sometime.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:15.720
Thanks.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.480
<i>Fighting, huh?</i>

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:22.310
<i>Tooru's probably depressed,</i>

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.310
<i>but Run looks the same as usual.</i>

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.820
It's rare to see you reading a book, Run.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.110
Really?

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:32.990
What are you reading?

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:36.790
Run...

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.910
That's upside-down.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.160
Huh?

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:41.750
Oh!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:58.310
In the event of an injury due to an accident or a mishap,

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:01.850
first attend to those at the scene...

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:02.900
Wow, this is long.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:05.360
Do the rest yourself! At least skim it all!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.110
What should we do?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.700
Hmm...

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.740
Nagi, aren't you worried?

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.870
Of course I am.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.210
But I don't know what to do.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.290
It hurts to see them like that.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:27.630
Yeah...

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:32.800
Ah, what should we do? I'm so worried.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.680
If you have any worries, I'll hear them!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.970
Kitou-sensei!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.850
Go on! Any sort of worry is fine!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.140
N-No, I'm not really worried about anything.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.020
Hold up!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.440
The worst thing you could do is bottle up your worries inside!

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.070
Now, open up your heart!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.280
L-Like I said, I'm not worried about anything.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.400
Don't hide it!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.320
Let me hear everything!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.830
Go on! Go on, go on, go on! Go on!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.370
What is there to be shy about?

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.910
N-No thank you!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.330
You won't regret it! Come on!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.500
Geez, I'm not worried about anything!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:10.460
Wait up, Yuuko-san! Don't be shy, open your heart to me!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.440
Run-chan...

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:33.940
Ah.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.410
Toorun looks down.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.070
Yutaka's gotta go cheer her up!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.490
What is it, Miporin?

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.250
We're heading back, Yutaka.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.580
I don't think Tooru-san's in the mood right now.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.590
Huh? But...

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.090
Come on, let's go.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.260
Ack! Miporin! I can't breathe...

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:10.940
I got away...

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.530
Tooru?

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.170
Actually, it bothers me, so I'm going to make up with her!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.130
To the school store!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.680
Wha- Hang on! What's the school store have to do with this?

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.440
I'll need sweets to make up with her.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.940
You're buying her back?

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.230
These, please!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.150
That will be 200 yen.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.830
Should I pay?

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:14.880
Oh!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.000
Huh?

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.560
Toorun looked down.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.770
Yutaka's worried.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.350
Yeah.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:56.730
Ah!

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:01.780
But I get the feeling she's fine now.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:11.950
Case closed, huh?

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.750
Honestly, that was bad for my heart.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:17.670
I don't have a handkerchief...

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.840
What's this, Nagi? Moved to tears?

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:21.800
Huh?

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.680
How could you not be moved by this?

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.930
K-Kitou-sensei! When did you-

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:30.930
Hm?

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.520
Come on. Let's go home, Yutaka.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.770
Right!

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:42.070
Toorun's gonna be cheerful tomorrow, right?

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:43.190
Probably.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.950
That means she'll play with me, right?

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.570
Only for three minutes.

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.530
Whaaaat?

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.970
I'm heading out now.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:12.100
'Kay.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:16.480
Later.

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.770
Yes, good work today.

00:23:57.490 --> 00:23:59.620
When summer is over, autumn comes in full force.

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:00.290
Too fast.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:02.250
It's way too fast. Don't you think so, Mipo-rin?!

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.120
Is it really?

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:04.880
It's Halloween already?

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:06.800
I won't forgive something like that.

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.300
Even if you say that to me...

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:10.840
Some of the important things haven't happened yet!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:15.550
For example, Tooru and I going moon gazing, or going to the sports carnival.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.100
There's no way that only the two of you are going.

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:19.720
Next time on A Channel, Present.

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:22.390
Obviously, I'll be coming along as well, right?

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:24.230
Mipo-rin is scary...
